      "writtenOn": "2023-04-05T07:47:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because the callback was unregistered (unrequestsocket), I don\u0027t think this should be called: clients are likely not to expect callbacks after registration. Instead, a client that unrequests a socket needs to stop using it by themselves. This is what MdnsAdvertiser does (it unrequests the socket when it\u0027s done using it).",
